@flyswiss have has terrible experiences with Swiss Air on more than one occasion. Given its recent string of operational and technical issues, this is hardly an airline I'd recommend anyone fly with.
My elderly parents were on LX154 from Zurich to Mumbai on 21 June, which was diverted after several hours in the air with virtually no explanation provided to passengers. We were forced to pay for an extra day's accommodation and other expenses and SWISS has offered no compensation whatsoever till date. The very next day, the same flight departed, only for two of the aircraft's toilets to become unusable mid-flight, forcing passengers to endure the remainder of the journey under unacceptable conditions.
This comes after multiple recent SWISS technical incidents and diversions, including an engine fire in Delhi in April 2026, returning to Mumbai after two hours of flying in May and other long haul operational disruptions. Safety should always come first, but communication, accountability and passenger care have been completely lacking.
